{"doc_id":"REPORT-news_r-03978-00001","summaries":{"A":{"adequacy":2,"critical_unsupported":1,"critical_omission":0,"wrong_unit_qualifier":0,"entity_relation":1,"fluency":4,"utility":3,"evidence":["주민들은 전날처럼 도로변에 길게 서서 피켓을 들고 무사한 귀가를 응원했다.","일부 교민들이 탄 버스 중 일부는 20분쯤 뒤인 오전 10시 20분 KTX 천안·아산역에 도착했다."],"reason":"The summary says the 교민 held the pickets, but in the source the 주민 (local residents) held them. That is a wrong actor, so entity_relation is flagged. It also leaves out the 16-day quarantine at 경찰인재개발원. The other facts are accurate."},"B":{"adequacy":2,"critical_unsupported":0,"critical_omission":0,"wrong_unit_qualifier":1,"entity_relation":1,"fluency":2,"utility":2,"evidence":["지난 1일 충남 아산의 경찰인재개발원에서 격리 생활을 시작한 지 16일 만이다.","이날 오전 10시쯤 ... 정문을 빠져나온"],"reason":"The summary says the 교민 returned on the 16th after starting quarantine, which blurs the 16-day span and the departure date and so distorts the timing. The last clause repeats the KTX arrival sentence almost word for word, which hurts fluency. It also omits the 아산시 mug gift and the residents' send-off."},"C":{"adequacy":2,"critical_unsupported":0,"critical_omission":1,"wrong_unit_qualifier":0,"entity_relation":1,"fluency":3,"utility":2,"evidence":["300여 여명의 주민들과 함께 전세버스를 타고 떠나는 교민들에게 손을 흔들며","교민들이 탄 버스 중 일부는 ... KTX 천안·아산역에 도착했다."],"reason":"The summary garbles the relation. It says 교민 left together with the 300 or so residents and that all 교민 arrived at the KTX station, when the source says only some of the buses did. It also omits the 16 days of quarantine and the context of the send-off."},"D":{"adequacy":4,"critical_unsupported":0,"critical_omission":0,"wrong_unit_qualifier":0,"entity_relation":0,"fluency":4,"utility":4,"evidence":["지난 1일 ... 격리 생활을 시작한 지 16일 만이다.","아산시는 교민들에게 머그잔을 선물로 증정했다."],"reason":"The summary covers the main facts accurately: the 334 returnees, the 16 days of quarantine, the officials' attendance and the gifts. It leaves out the residents' send-off and the KTX arrival, which are minor omissions. The phrase '16일 ... 16일 만에' is slightly awkward."}}}
